<title>AUSTRALIA: Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</title>
<headline>Biggest gains/falls for ASX 100 index in last week.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-05-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a list of the 10 largest gaining and falling stocks for Australian companies included in the Australian Stock Exchange's ASX 100 index for the week to May 16.</p>
<p>Top 10 gains in week     Price     percent</p>
<p>Rank Name		    May 16    change</p>
<p>1   ARGO Investments     3.05	7.39</p>
<p>2   Pasminco		 2.66	7.26</p>
<p>3   Comalco		  7.02	6.36</p>
<p>4   Incitec		  6.75	6.30</p>
<p>5   HIH Winterthur	 2.97	6.07</p>
<p>6   Fletcher Energy	4.20	5.79</p>
<p>7   Sons of Gwalia	 5.75	5.31</p>
<p>8   Jupiters		 3.06	4.79</p>
<p>9   MIM Holdings	   1.82	4.60</p>
<p>10  Howard Smith	  11.90	4.29</p>
<p>Top 10 falls in week    Price    percent</p>
<p>Rank Name		   May 2    change</p>
<p>1   Burns Philp	    1.85     -13.95</p>
<p>2   Email		    4.00	-5.44</p>
<p>3   Crown		    2.04	-5.12</p>
<p>4   Westfield Hold	23.30	-4.90</p>
<p>5   News Corp		5.76	-4.64</p>
<p>6   Coles Myer	     6.16	-4.05</p>
<p>7   South Pac Pet	  3.55	-4.05</p>
<p>8   Westfield America    1.04	-3.70</p>
<p>9   News preferred	 4.77	-3.64</p>
<p>10  CSR			4.60.1    -3.54</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 373-1800</p>
